🔄 How It Works
text
1. User registers / logs in → JWT token issued
2. User creates a new project
3. User provides architecture input:
   - Text description, OR
   - Code files upload (Python/Java), OR
   - Diagram upload
4. Backend pipeline:
   a. Static Analysis  → parse code, extract dependencies
   b. Knowledge Graph  → build nodes + edges (NetworkX)
   c. GraphRAG         → embed + retrieve relevant patterns
   d. Gemini API       → detect flaws, recommend fixes, build roadmap
5. Results saved to SQLite
6. Frontend displays:
   - Dashboard with metrics + charts
   - Interactive graph (React Flow)
   - Flaw list + recommendation cards
   - Modernization roadmap timeline
   - Downloadable PDF report
