Push karne ke baad GitHub pe check kar:

□ .gitignore file dikh rahi hai root me
□ backend/.env NAHI dikh rahi
□ backend/venv/ NAHI dikh rahi
□ frontend/node_modules/ NAHI dikh rahi
□ backend/data/app.db NAHI dikh rahi (agar bani ho)
□ README.md dikh rahi hai
□ .env.example dikh rahi hai (ye push hona chahiye — template hai)
