🚀 AB YE COMMANDS CHALAO
Step 1: .gitignore file banao root me
PowerShell me:

bash
cd C:\Users\HP\ai-architecture-reviewer
notepad .gitignore
Notepad khulega → upar wala content paste kar → Save kar → Band kar.

Step 2: Verify karo .gitignore sahi bana
bash
dir .gitignore
Ya:

bash
type .gitignore
Content dikhna chahiye.

Step 3: Git me add karo
bash
git add .gitignore
git status
Ab check kar — .env, venv/, node_modules/ untracked list me NAHI dikhne chahiye (agar wo files hain bhi). ✅

Step 4: Commit karo
bash
git commit -m "chore: add comprehensive .gitignore"
Step 5: Push karo
bash
git push origin main
⚠️ AGAR .env YA venv PEHLE SE PUSH HO GAYA HO
Check karo GitHub pe jao:

text
https://github.com/vishakha2121/ai-architecture-reviewer
Agar backend/.env ya node_modules/ ya venv/ dikh raha hai toh ye commands chala (cached files hata):

bash
# Remove from git cache (files local me rahengi)
git rm -r --cached backend/.env
git rm -r --cached backend/venv
git rm -r --cached frontend/node_modules
git rm -r --cached node_modules
git rm -r --cached backend/data/app.db

# Ab commit karo
git add .
git commit -m "chore: remove sensitive/generated files from tracking"
git push origin main
Aur agar .env push ho gaya tha, toh Gemini API key TURANT rotate kar:

https://aistudio.google.com/apikey pe jao

Purani key delete kar

Nayi key generate kar

