git status

# 3. Sab add karo
git add .

# 4. Commit
git commit -m "chore: add complete .gitignore and project structure"

# 5. Push
git push origin main
🧠 KYUN YE .gitignore IMPORTANT HAI
File/Folder	Kyun Ignore Kiya
.env	🔐 SECRET — Gemini API key, JWT secret. Leak = disaster
venv/	📦 200+ MB, har machine pe rebuild hota hai
node_modules/	📦 300+ MB, npm install se aata hai
__pycache__/	🗑️ Auto-generated by Python
*.db	🗄️ Local DB, alag machine pe different hota
chroma_db/	🧠 Vector embeddings, rebuild ho sakte hain
dist/, build/	🏗️ Build outputs, CI/CD banata hai
.DS_Store, Thumbs.db	🖥️ OS junk files
Rule of thumb: Secrets, dependencies, generated files → .gitignore me daal. Source code, config templates, docs → push kar.

✅ VERIFICATION CHECKLIST
Push karne ke baad GitHub pe check kar:

□ .gitignore file dikh rahi hai root me
□ backend/.env NAHI dikh rahi
□ backend/venv/ NAHI dikh rahi
□ frontend/node_modules/ NAHI dikh rahi
□ backend/data/app.db NAHI dikh rahi (agar bani ho)
□ README.md dikh rahi hai
□ .env.example dikh rahi hai (ye push hona chahiye — template hai)
📋 AGAR CONFUSION HO — ONE-SHOT COMMAND
Sab kuch ek saath — .gitignore bana + add + commit + push:

powershell
cd C:\Users\HP\ai-architecture-reviewer
notepad .gitignore   # Content paste karo, save karo
git add .gitignore
git commit -m "chore: add comprehensive .gitignore"
git push origin main
